  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> Baron’s Secluded Library</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Artifice Sphere</p>\n<p>When attempting a challenge as part of dynamic magic item creation, you may spend a use of skill leverage to attempt both tasks yourself.</p>\n<p>If a challenge from dynamic magic item creation results in a failure, you may spend a use of skill leverage to change the result into a success, in which case the item gains an additional quirk.</p>\n<p>If a challenge from dynamic magic item creation results in a critical failure, you may spend a use of skill leverage to reduce the result to a normal failure (in which case the item gains an additional quirk) or a success (in which case the item gains an additional flaw).</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/artifice#toc63\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
